			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "MOD : Torchmaster (@torchmaster)"
			description: [
				"&4&l研究：&r&4火把大师"
				""
				"&eAh, an old favorite was put into the FOPGame Server I see! Torchmaster is quite a popular brand in The Ferret Business' own exploration endeavours. Not surprised to see the FOP has copied it into their own place too."
				""
				"&e在充满敌意和危险的地方，你需要某种魔法或科技来防止恶心的生物出现在营地附近。巨型火把就是其中之一。"
				""
				"&ePlace it, and in a very large radius around it, hostile creatures cannot (usually) spawn. I say usually, because as is with magic and the laws of the universe, sometimes something just doesn't agree with the Mega Torch and appears anyways."
				""
				"&e不过，能阻止99.9%的敌对生物，也已经相当不错了！"
			]
